👑🧠 Birbal and the Greedy Barber (Raw Story)

One day, a barber came to Emperor Akbar and said, “Your Majesty, I have a special power. I can talk to people in heaven.”

Akbar was surprised.

The greedy barber continued, “If you send me there, I can deliver messages to your ancestors.”

Akbar did not believe him and asked Birbal for advice.

Birbal understood the barber was lying.

He said, “We will send you to heaven in a special way.”

Birbal ordered a large fire to be prepared.

When the barber saw the fire, he became frightened.

“I was joking!” he cried.

“I cannot go to heaven!”

Birbal smiled and said, “Then you should not lie.”

Akbar punished the barber for his greed and dishonesty.

💖 Moral:

Greed and lies lead to trouble.
